    "text": "BY virtue of the powers vested in me under the Article 45(2) of the Constitution of the Democratic Socialist Republic ofSri Lanka, I, do hereby declare that the following functions of the subjects under the purview of Ministry of Educationshall be entrusted with the State Minister of Education.",
